- Structure: scroll-progress, navbar (8 items), hero (5 buttons), about, news (tabs + aurora rail timeline), research, projects (data-see-more="3"), publications (fixed Scholar ID + SIGIR DOI), CV (FlowCV iframe + 3 tl-group sections + see-more), service, contact (10 cards), footer (social strip)
- Key HTML patterns:
